Slim, yes, but not impossible.  A friend of mine says he once found
Mjollnir -resting at his feet on the up-stair on level 1-.

I get the sense, though, from your post that part of the surprise is
that such a powerful weapon was generated early.  While it's nice to
see, it's really not that worthy of surprise.  Unlike most games,
including some roguelikes, Nethack does not weight object generation
to dungeon difficulty.  The only thing preventing most weapon
artifacts from being generated early is simple rarity.

By the way, Vorpal Blade, as far as weapons go, isn't really that
great.  It can behead foes roughly 5% of the time, and that's just
about its only power besides instantly slaying Jabberwocks.

